rtment name, academic year, number of unique subjects offered, minimum start date of the term, and for each subject offered in the term '2017JA' in that department, show the subject title, number of enrolled students, responsible faculty name, offering department name, department full name, school name, and the minimum number of enrolled students in a window of 3 preceding and 1 following row ordered by the department code. Do not return any rounded answers."
